# AMD/Radeon GPU support.
#
# The amdgpu kernel driver is in linux-image by default; this profile
# adds the userspace Mesa drivers (GL + Vulkan) and the firmware blobs
# that newer Radeon GPUs need to come up. firmware-amd-graphics lives
# in Debian's `non-free-firmware` component, which trixie enables by
# default.
mesa-vulkan-drivers
mesa-utils
libgl1-mesa-dri
firmware-amd-graphics
# Optional but useful for diagnosing display issues from a serial
# console while bringing a new machine up.
radeontop
